    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n154" root="اتو" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتْوَانُ</span></b>  a corroborative [or imitative sequent] of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْوَانُ</span>, which signifies <i>grieving mourning,</i> or
<i>sorrowful:</i> (TA:) or <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيصٌ</span> [<i>vehemently
desirous; eager;</i> &amp;c.]. (Mirkát el-Loghah, cited
by Golius.)

